Template: library/target
Type: select
Choices: ${CHOICES}
Description: Which internal disk should Debian erase and replace?
 ALL partitions and files on the selected disk will be removed, including
 Rocky Linux or any other installed operating system. USB disks are excluded.

Template: library/erase-confirm
Type: boolean
Default: false
Description: Erase the entire disk ${TARGET}?
 Debian will replace every partition on this disk. This includes any
 existing operating systems and data. Choose No to stop disk setup.

Template: library/no-target
Type: error
Description: No eligible internal installation disk was found
 Automatic disk setup excludes USB disks, removable disks, and the installer
 medium. No disk has been erased. Check the storage controller configuration
 or use Debian's manual partitioner to select an appropriate target.
